"EditVMViewControllerNetworkVF.descriptionBridged" = "In Bridge network you let the VM use one of the physical network devices connected to your Mac to reach the network. The VM will behave exactly as a computer connected to the Mac network, and it will both see and be visible by the other network devices. The bandwdth is shared between th VM and your Mac.";
